Package: baseballr.data
Title: Build and Publish NCAA Baseball Data Releases
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Saiem", "Gilani", , "saiem.gilani@gmail.com", role = c("cre", "aut"))
Description: Processing scripts that build clean, tidy NCAA college baseball
    schedule and play-by-play datasets and publish them as GitHub release
    assets on 'sportsdataverse/sportsdataverse-data', where the 'baseballr'
    package load_ncaa_baseball_*() functions read them from. This is a
    data-pipeline repository, not a CRAN package.
License: CC BY 4.0
URL: https://github.com/sportsdataverse/baseballr-data
BugReports: https://github.com/sportsdataverse/baseballr-data/issues
